{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05536","headline":"清谿馆作 · 谈戭","name":"清谿馆作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"指途清谿里，左右唯深林。\n云蔽望乡处，雨愁爲客心。\n遇人多物役，听鸟时幽音。\n何必沧浪水，庶兹浣尘襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谈戭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}